A||||3||Fearless Freep||BMW Z3 Goes Down Hard||||1||
Z||000000||Fearless Freep||09-14-2000||04:52 PM||||Pulling outta where I work.  Pull up to a 4 way stop.  Well....as the story goes a BMW Z3 pulls around to the right hand lane.  I dont think much of it..(but I turn the ol AC off anyway and put down the windows a bit to hear his engine).  Light turns green and I do a casual creep along....well he gets 1 full car length ahead of me and floors it.....course that just got the blood racing....I put my foot to the gas and chirp the tires through 2 third and damn near grabbed 4th.  Pulled a full car length ahead of him by the time we got to the next light.  Well then he pulls into my lane as we get ready to hit the on ramp to the beltline.  The light turns green and I do a casual creep (like Im in no rush to get anywhere)...that butthead (as if he didnt have enough already) revs his engine at me again!!  Well I proceeded to do a repeat of the above steps...this time taking it up to 80mph.....It took him a good 15-20 seconds to finally catch up...course by then I was using some serious cruise control and listening to some CCR.   <P>Had to be a 4cyl model...... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  made me happy anyways...||||reg||1
Z||000001||Blade||09-14-2000||06:38 PM||||hehe i turn of the ac if i see a nice car too :P<P>Blade||||reg||1
