Z||000003||gtsonly||09-14-2000||07:51 PM||||what engine you runnin'? I have never grabbed thrid in my car and it has a 2.8 in it. Have you modified it in anyway? Was the Z3 being driven by a old lady? I would never think of running a Z3, those thing are fast as all can get. I will be the first to admit i would get smoked if i tried to run a BMW and it's not that my car is slow but a BMW is just faster<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPS<BR>http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/ubbmisc.cgi||||reg||5
